nner.\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Robux\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221030053917\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Robux.png\" data-image-key=\"Robux.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(#F7F7FE, #939397); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">149 Robux</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>VIP\n</td>\n<td>Reduces Summon prices by <b>20%,</b> gives the Player an <b>Exclusive Nametag,</b> and gives <b>100% Time Machine</b> rewards\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Robux\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Robux.png\" data-image-key=\"Robux.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221030053917\" /></a></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(#F7F7FE, #939397); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">299 Robux</span>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Shiny Hunter\n</td>\n<td>Gives the Player a 3x chance for a <b>Shiny</b> unit\n</td>\n<td><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053917\" class=\"mw-file-de